# Broadcast logs.
#
# forge init ships `!/broadcast` here, which negates the `broadcast/` rule in
# the repository root .gitignore and silently re-adds these on the next
# `git add -A`. They are build output; the addresses that matter are recorded
# in PROGRESS.md and spec.md section 3.
/broadcast/

